     //
+    // Declared unconditionally on purpose. ENABLE_OPENGL_ES is defined by
+    // libvgcode's own CMakeLists and by nothing else, so it is not set while
+    // this header is being read by src/slic3r - guarding the declarations would
+    // hide them from the only caller there is.
+    //
+    // Cap the instances a single toolpath or options draw may submit, so that a
+    // preview too big to draw at full detail can still be drawn at reduced
+    // detail without rebuilding anything. Zero, the default, draws everything.
+    //
+    // Every other way of making this scene cheaper - narrowing the view range,
+    // hiding roles, hiding options - goes through update_enabled_entities(),
